Copyright (c) 2017 Sam Verschueren, MIT licence (LICENSE). The fixed release (0.5.0)
is an ES module, which query-string 7 cannot require(). This keeps 0.2.2's CommonJS
API and its replacement rules, and replaces its retry-every-split decoder, whose cost
grew with the length of a run of malformed escapes (GHSA-vcc3-ghjq-m6fr), by one that
